 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + Piscataquis Judicial Center - Dover-Foxcroft\, Maine\n  + All jurors 
 on State vs Kerr need to appear on Tuesday morning at 9:30 am. ( 1 hour la
 ter than originally told) If you have any questions please call 564-2240.\
 n  + If there is inclement weather\, please go to www.courts.maine.gov for
  updates.\n  + PROHIBITION OF ELECTRONIC DEVICES: Please be advised that p
 ursuant to Administrative Order JB-20-01\, use of electronic devices durin
 g trial or while in deliberations are prohibited and all devices will need
  to be temporarily surrendered. During jury selection\, all devices must b
 e turned off.\n  + September 25\, 0000\n  + All Jurors selected for Panel 
 B\, in the matter of State v Cheng\, due to scheduling complications\, our
  trial will be starting later than expected. Please call our Jury line aft
 er 9am on Monday\, September 28\, 2026 to see what time you will need to a
 ppear at Court for the Trial. 1-800-872-5539.\n  + Jurors Numbered: 163 67
