 n  + Traverse Jurors\n  + please report to the Waldo Judicial Center on Tu
 esday October 6th 9:00 am for Jury Selection. Bring with you your complete
 d white card\, yellow card\, and drivers license or state ID for check in.
  Upon arrival check in with the clerk's office.\n  + September 25\, 2026\n
   + The following September Traverse Jurors are to report to the York Judi
 cial Center in Biddeford on Monday\, September 28th at 9:30am\n  + 1\, 6\,
